# EventCard on DemoPage

- Demo lives in `EventCardsDemo.vue` only.
- Prefer `<EventCard variant="orangeButton" />` (presets inside `EventCard.vue` with assetMap + `eventCard.*` i18n).
- Also valid: `theme` + `hasButton` when not using `variant`.
- Show Code must stay short and pasteable.
- No hardcoded user-facing copy; no `demo.` keys inside Show Code.
